---
source: crates/omnifs-cli/tests/cli_transcripts.rs
expression: "fixture.transcript(&fixture.run(&[\"provider\", \"--help\"]))"
---
exit: 0
stdout:
Add, list, show, or remove Provider resources

Usage: omnifs provider [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  add   Add an embedded or local Wasm provider resource
  ls    List desired Provider resources
  show  Show one desired Provider resource
  rm    Remove one Provider resource
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

Global options:
  -v, --verbose...       Increase tracing verbosity. -v = info, -vv = debug with span events.
                         Overridden by `RUST_LOG`
      --output <OUTPUT>  Output contract for this invocation [default: human] [possible values:
                         human, json, jsonl]
  -q, --quiet            Suppress conversational narration on stderr. Receipts, progress settle
                         lines, and errors are preserved
      --no-input         Reject prompts and browser handoffs
      --yes              Approve confirmation-only decisions
